1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,740
We will prove worthy of your sacrifice.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:07,340
We will prove worthy of your time on earth.

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,920
We will make you proud.

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,280
We will finish the job.

5
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:15,900
We will defeat the forces of darkness and evil.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,000
And we will stand every day for what is true,

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,160
what is beautiful, what is good.

8
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:26,160
And we will achieve victory for our children,

9
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:29,340
for our families, for our civilization,

10
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:32,380
and for every patriot who stands with us.

11
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,140
God bless you.

12
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,880
God bless Turning Point.

13
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,500
God bless Erica.

14
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,660
God bless the Kirk family.

15
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,560
God bless our heroes.

16
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,980
And God bless the United States of America.

17
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,820
Thank you.

